@startuml 04_diagrama_estructura_compuesta
title REBA — Diagrama de estructura compuesta (internos de RebaAPI / process_upload)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "RebaAPI «FastAPI app — proceso uvicorn»" {

  ' ---- Puertos del sistema completo ----
  portin "«HTTP in :5000»" as pinHTTP
  portout "«WS events out»" as poutWS
  portout "«device config txt»" as poutCFG
  portout "«static files»" as poutStatic

  ' ---- Partes: endpoints ----
  component "upload_photo()\n«POST /upload»" as partUpload
  component "REST router /api/*\n«~15 GET + 4 POST»" as partREST
  component "device_config handlers\n«GET txt · admin GET/POST»" as partDevCfg
  component "pump_cmd service\n«/api/pump/run · /ack»" as partPump
  component "export_yolo()\n«ZIP dataset»" as partExport
  component "websocket_endpoint()\n«/ws handshake + push»" as partWS

  ' ---- Partes: pipeline interno ----
  component "process_upload()" as partPipe {
    component "validar JPEG\n«magic bytes + tamaño + decode»" as vVal
    component "InferenceEngine.predict\n«ONNX letterbox→NCHW→NMS»" as vInf
    component "_draw_boxes + _scale_detections" as vDraw
    component "persistencia\n«captures + detections + counters»" as vDB
    component "pump_progress()\n«conteo→ciclo inferido»" as vPump
    vVal --> vInf : frame BGR
    vInf --> vDraw : detections[]
    vDraw --> vDB : doble JPEG
    vDB --> vPump : photos_since_pump
  }

  ' ---- Partes: servicios de fondo ----
  component "_retention_loop()\n«cada 1 h → prune_captures»" as partRet
  component "broadcast()\n«fan-out a clientes WS»" as partBC
  component "device_state\n«heartbeat <150 s»" as partDev
  component "Settings (.env)" as partCfg

  ' ---- Conectores ----
  pinHTTP --> partUpload
  pinHTTP --> partREST
  pinHTTP --> partDevCfg
  pinHTTP --> partPump
  pinHTTP --> partExport
  pinHTTP --> partWS

  partUpload --> partPipe : body JPEG
  partPipe --> partBC : capture/detections/pump_event
  partBC --> partWS : encola mensaje
  partWS --> poutWS

  partDevCfg --> poutCFG : clave=valor
  partPump --> partDevCfg : escribe pump_cmd
  partDevCfg --> partDev : touch
  partUpload --> partDev : touch (heartbeat)

  partREST --> partPipe : lecturas (stats/captures/timeseries)
  partREST --> partBC : snapshot inicial
  partExport --> partPipe : get_captures_for_export

  partRet --> partPipe : prune_captures
  partPipe --> partCfg : umbrales/clases
  partRet --> partCfg : CAPTURE_RETENTION

  poutStatic --> partREST : monta static/
}

note bottom of partPipe
  Orden estricto por upload:
  1) validar → 2) inferir → 3) dibujar → 4) persistir → 5) broadcast.
  Cada paso tolera fallo parcial: foto se guarda aunque ONNX falle (source:none).
end note

note bottom of partDevCfg
  device_config = tabla key/value con whitelist de 8 claves.
  pump_cmd solo se sirve si <10 min (TTL anti bomba fantasma).
  El firmware re-valida TODO al aplicar — el server confía pero no obedece.
end note

@enduml
